Notes							
•  Register reflects construction work-order invoices issued to DER program-scope applicants and postings to the WO subledger.							
•  Invoice Date is the date the invoice was issued from the WO subledger; Posted Date is the date the cash application was posted to the general ledger.							
•  Open Balance = Invoice Amount − Posted Amount as of the "As of" date above.							
•  Rows without a Posted Date carry the full invoice amount as Open Balance and remain in the on-hold queue under non-payment status.							
•  Domestic rooftop projects are outside DER program scope and are not tracked here.							